{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IDOLZ is a multiplayer fighting game where hitting isn't enough: you also have to know how to insult.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With voices dubbed by Spoksponha, Foyone, Socio Ejecutor, and more beautiful people...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/60de8e5ebdb81be791e09cd6902cbd3e.poster.avif?t=1753099609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/60de8e5ebdb81be791e09cd6902cbd3e.webm?t=1753099609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/60de8e5ebdb81be791e09cd6902cbd3e.mp4?t=1753099609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your fighter with: Introductions, Celebrations, Skins, Insults, Stages, and even music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/95dea4249bb2d236adeb06401860d58f.poster.avif?t=1753099609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/95dea4249bb2d236adeb06401860d58f.webm?t=1753099609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/95dea4249bb2d236adeb06401860d58f.mp4?t=1753099609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ESPECIALES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Special attacks don't just deal damage, they also humiliate your opponent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During combat, insults fill your flow bar, allowing you to activate a special attack to destroy your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From diamond showers to out-of-control drones, special attacks in IDOLZ can turn the tide of combat in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/585246ca947446dc58b91e25dfb5576e.poster.avif?t=1753099609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/585246ca947446dc58b91e25dfb5576e.webm?t=1753099609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/585246ca947446dc58b91e25dfb5576e.mp4?t=1753099609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/6eb74fc56d9d0993a8650ea7e870c560.avif?t=1753099609\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prank Pack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Performances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Celebrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Songs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Everything unlocked so you can try it right away!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ONLINE MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Casual</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1-on-1 onl