 away!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ONLINE MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Casual</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1-on-1 online duel, direct and unfiltered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced battles, insults everywhere, and guaranteed laughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>With Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite your favorite friend...or at least your favorite one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caution: this game can break up friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/72f2f06497dfef9de3b7ca14335aad02.poster.avif?t=1753099609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/72f2f06497dfef9de3b7ca14335aad02.webm?t=1753099609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/extras/72f2f06497dfef9de3b7ca14335aad02.mp4?t=1753099609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i><u>DOWNLOAD THE DEMO NOW AND HELP US IMPROVE THE GAME!!!</u></i></strong></h2></li></ul>","developers":[" DNC CREW"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3138400","name":"IDOLZ"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845270/b7eb5c248543f440dc758b365a3c439db62d1fd3/header.jpg?t=1753099609","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"IDOLZ TEAM All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><